### Example 3: Connect™ Integration Monitoring Embeddable Module

**Business Capability:** Real-time transaction monitoring and integration health status embedded in other products

**Scope:**
- **Routes:** `/integration-monitoring` (standalone), or embedded in host application
- **UI Components:** Transaction Status Dashboard, Integration Health Indicators, Error Log Viewer, FHIR API Status Widgets
- **Backend Integration:** Integration Service API, Message Queue Metrics, API Gateway Status Endpoints
- **State Management:** Real-time transaction feeds, filter preferences, cached status results

**Team:** Connect™ Integration Team (8 developers)

**Repository:** `gainwell/connect-integration-mfe`

**Embeddable Widget Pattern:**

```typescript
// Connect Integration MFE exposes embeddable widgets
export const widgets = {
  TransactionStatus: (props: { claimId: string }) => {
    // Self-contained widget with own data fetching and rendering
    const [status, loading] = useFetchTransactionStatus(props.claimId);
    return <StatusIndicator status={status} loading={loading} />;
  },

  IntegrationHealth: (props: { partnerId: string }) => {
    const health = useFetchIntegrationHealth(props.partnerId);
    return <HealthPanel health={health} />;
  },
};

// Host application (Enterprise™) embeds Connect™ widget
import { widgets } from '@gainwell/connect-integration-mfe';

function ClaimDetailsPage({ claimId }) {
  return (
    <div>
      <ClaimDetails claimId={claimId} />
      {/* Embed Connect™ transaction status directly in Claim details */}
      <widgets.TransactionStatus claimId={claimId} />
    </div>
  );
}
```
